  "findings": "NPS A Kirby, Agnieszka Kwiecien and B Lezius actual photos: slender culms above narrow basal leaves, several drooping cotton fruit heads. Cotton is fruiting stage and is excluded from this vegetative spring instance. Current three-size pilots (seeds 1,4,7) and every panel of36-seed contact sheet visually reviewed. Narrow basal foliage plus slender culms replace broad leafless fan; 23\u201347 cm. No mature white cotton fruiting heads in chosen spring vegetative model. Fine blade widths remain voxel-limited. Accepted as stylized spring source; variant endorsement remains a user decision.",
